# Tenant Isolation (CRITICAL)
Every request must enforce PostgreSQL Row-Level Security (RLS).
Do NOT implement tenant isolation in the application layer (e.g., `query.filter(company_id=X)`). 
You must use a session-scoped hook to set the database context:
`SET LOCAL app.current_tenant = :tenant_id`